1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:24,850 --> 00:02:26,180
A handprint ?

25
00:02:26,970 --> 00:02:30,580
A single hand damaged the gate of the Celestial Realm so much ?

26
00:02:31,530 --> 00:02:34,610
This must have been a very large platform before...

27
00:02:34,430 --> 00:02:36,120
But some kind of fight

28
00:02:36,390 --> 00:02:38,080
shattered it to this extent.

29
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:41,440
How powerful was that spell ?

30
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:47,550
First, I need to set up a restriction

31
00:02:47,780 --> 00:02:49,840
as well as a recovery formation.

32
00:02:50,670 --> 00:02:52,930
If I get hurt in the Celestial Realm,

33
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:53,720
after coming out,

34
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:56,200
I can always come back here to recover.

35
00:02:57,230 --> 00:02:59,920
I didn't expect a platform could be this useful.

36
00:02:59,910 --> 00:03:00,960
Move aside !

37
00:03:02,510 --> 00:03:03,560
Fellow cultivator,

38
00:03:03,910 --> 00:03:05,600
please leave this platform

39
00:03:05,550 --> 00:03:06,960
and find another one.

40
00:03:15,270 --> 00:03:18,140
He's... from the Giant Demon Clan ?

41
00:03:13,160 --> 00:03:16,050
Chi Hu
Giant Demon Clan's young master
Middle stage Soul Formation

42
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:31,190
Late stage Soul Formation ?

43
00:03:31,510 --> 00:03:32,880
Please forgive me.

44
00:03:46,390 --> 00:03:47,920
He is very strong.

45
00:03:46,550 --> 00:03:48,820
Sun Tai
Corpse Sect Head Elder
Middle stage Soul Transformation

46
00:03:48,110 --> 00:03:49,240
I can't offend him.

47
00:03:49,350 --> 00:03:50,400
Junior Brother,

48
00:03:50,710 --> 00:03:52,200
come with me.

49
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:53,490
Zhou Yi
Five Elements Sect disciple
Middle stage Soul Transformation

50
00:03:53,990 --> 00:03:55,480
Why him ?

51
00:03:55,470 --> 00:03:56,770
He's disgusting.

52
00:03:56,510 --> 00:03:59,000
I need to find someone with a low cultivation level.

53
00:04:03,670 --> 00:04:06,680
Zhai Ban
Early stage Soul Formation

54
00:04:05,390 --> 00:04:07,280
Early stage Soul Formation...

55
00:04:07,710 --> 00:04:09,360
But I can't underestimate

56
00:04:09,550 --> 00:04:11,040
his domain.

57
00:04:11,630 --> 00:04:13,520
This guy will be hard to deal with.

58
00:04:13,950 --> 00:04:15,200
Why don't

59
00:04:14,990 --> 00:04:16,600
I choose him instead ?

60
00:04:18,430 --> 00:04:19,640
Fellow cultivator,

61
00:04:19,830 --> 00:04:21,200
please leave this platform

62
00:04:21,590 --> 00:04:22,960
and find another one.

63
00:04:25,190 --> 00:04:27,360
Then don't blame me for being rude !

64
00:04:32,310 --> 00:04:33,720
This is...

65
00:04:33,670 --> 00:04:34,920
A Thunder Toad !

66
00:04:51,030 --> 00:04:52,440
Have I...

67
00:04:52,870 --> 00:04:55,120
seen him somewhere before ?

68
00:05:00,590 --> 00:05:02,400
The Return Cauldron,

69
00:05:03,070 --> 00:05:04,840
can be activated

70
00:05:05,070 --> 00:05:06,800
at certain locations

71
00:05:07,150 --> 00:05:09,720
and after an incense stick of time

72
00:05:09,750 --> 00:05:11,720
it allows you to leave the Celestial Realm

73
00:05:11,830 --> 00:05:14,360
and return to your cultivation planet.

74
00:05:27,630 --> 00:05:28,380
Is this

75
00:05:28,750 --> 00:05:30,360
the Celestial Realm ?

76
00:05:28,910 --> 00:05:32,110
Rain Celestial Realm

77
00:05:36,310 --> 00:05:37,850
This one will do.

78
00:05:53,750 --> 00:05:55,280
Spirit stones ?

79
00:05:56,070 --> 00:05:58,160
Could it be that this whole palace

80
00:05:58,390 --> 00:06:00,560
is made of spirit stones ?

81
00:06:05,390 --> 00:06:06,570
What a pity...

82
00:06:08,110 --> 00:06:10,520
When it was at its prime,

83
00:06:10,510 --> 00:06:13,120
how grand must this place have been.

84
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:15,630
The celestial spiritual energy

85
00:06:15,500 --> 00:06:18,210
is countless times purer than regular spiritual energy.

86
00:06:18,670 --> 00:06:20,640
Since the Celestial Realm is shattered,

87
00:06:21,110 --> 00:06:22,640
celestial spiritual energy

88
00:06:23,070 --> 00:06:24,840
is very scarce.

89
00:06:27,550 --> 00:06:29,320
What kind of spell

90
00:06:29,830 --> 00:06:32,000
could have destroyed this place ?

91
00:06:33,190 --> 00:06:35,680
What happened in the Celestial Realm back then ?

92
00:06:36,910 --> 00:06:39,640
A few days later

93
00:06:40,550 --> 00:06:43,080
"Gifted by the fifth Rain Celestial Emperor

94
00:06:43,070 --> 00:06:45,240
to Celestial Scholar Tian Hua..."

95
00:06:47,870 --> 00:06:51,280
This celestial palace is so luxurious !

96
00:06:52,550 --> 00:06:54,480
It must have belonged

97
00:06:54,550 --> 00:06:56,090
to a Celestial King !

98
00:06:57,310 --> 00:07:01,060
This tablet should have been outside to allow people to read it.

99
00:07:00,870 --> 00:07:03,200
But now it's hidden deep inside the palace.

100
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:05,410
Weird...

101
00:07:08,190 --> 00:07:09,930
There's a restriction here !

102
00:07:23,150 --> 00:07:25,080
Celestial spiritual energy !

103
00:07:29,060 --> 00:07:30,650
The celestial spiritual energy

104
00:07:30,390 --> 00:07:32,610
must be condensed with an Origin Soul

105
00:07:32,470 --> 00:07:33,760
into jades

106
00:07:33,950 --> 00:07:35,160
to be used later.

107
00:07:40,150 --> 00:07:41,200
Stop !

108
00:07:40,550 --> 00:07:42,960
Hong Wen
Da Lou Sword Sect
Early stage Soul Formation

109
00:07:41,870 --> 00:07:45,960
This place was discovered 3000 years ago by the Da Lou Sword Sect.

110
00:07:46,180 --> 00:07:47,760
If you continue,

111
00:07:47,950 --> 00:07:49,400
the Da Lou Sword Sect

112
00:07:49,470 --> 00:07:51,360
will kill you !

113
00:08:02,340 --> 00:08:03,320
Thunder...

114
00:08:03,190 --> 00:08:04,240
Thunder Toad !

115
00:08:04,350 --> 00:08:05,440
Ridiculous.

116
00:08:05,870 --> 00:08:07,110
When did your sect

117
00:08:07,190 --> 00:08:09,010
become the owner of the Celestial Realm ?

118
00:08:09,510 --> 00:08:10,330
Go !

119
00:08:14,990 --> 00:08:16,730
The Da Lou sword

120
00:08:16,590 --> 00:08:19,520
is one of the top artifacts of the Da Lou Sword Sect.

121
00:08:20,310 --> 00:08:22,240
Cultivators of the same level

122
00:08:22,350 --> 00:08:24,360
cannot withstand its attacks.

123
00:08:24,710 --> 00:08:27,280
This person is clearly Early stage Soul Formation

124
00:08:27,710 --> 00:08:29,720
but his Thunder Toad

125
00:08:29,510 --> 00:08:32,120
is as strong as a Middle stage Soul Formation.

126
00:08:32,350 --> 00:08:34,400
Who is this guy ?

127
00:08:38,230 --> 00:08:40,050
The Celestial Realm is shattered.

128
00:08:39,870 --> 00:08:42,530
Although the formation of this palace has been mostly destroyed,

129
00:08:42,350 --> 00:08:44,450
it's still somewhat operational.

130
00:08:45,230 --> 00:08:46,450
Given enough time,

131
00:08:46,750 --> 00:08:49,890
it will automatically gather scattered celestial spiritual energy

132
00:08:49,670 --> 00:08:51,730
and condense it here.

133
00:08:52,430 --> 00:08:54,930
After the Da Lou Sword Sect discovered this,

134
00:08:54,710 --> 00:08:56,480
you hid it beneath this tablet

135
00:08:56,830 --> 00:08:58,800
and you come here regularly

136
00:08:59,070 --> 00:09:00,400
to harvest it.

137
00:09:01,070 --> 00:09:03,690
Am I... wrong ?

138
00:09:04,790 --> 00:09:05,640
No.

139
00:09:05,750 --> 00:09:07,760
I am not his match.

140
00:09:14,870 --> 00:09:16,760
Such a small jade

141
00:09:17,230 --> 00:09:19,930
is equivalent to almost half of Zhao's spiritual energy

142
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:21,440
if it was all combined.

143
00:09:22,910 --> 00:09:24,160
For now,

144
00:09:24,380 --> 00:09:26,120
I can only try my best

145
00:09:25,910 --> 00:09:27,320
to stall him.

146
00:09:44,630 --> 00:09:45,840
You just wait !

147
00:09:46,190 --> 00:09:47,690
I will find my Senior Brother,

148
00:09:47,920 --> 00:09:49,240
and we will kick your ass.

149
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:52,120
You will never be able to get out of the Celestial Realm !

150
00:09:53,510 --> 00:09:54,760
Running away ?

151
00:10:11,790 --> 00:10:14,830
Teleportation formations in the Celestial Realm ?

152
00:10:14,710 --> 00:10:16,600
This sect is a big deal.

153
00:10:29,110 --> 00:10:30,280
You rat...

154
00:10:30,550 --> 00:10:32,320
Don't you know I'm Soul Formation ?

155
00:10:32,270 --> 00:10:33,840
As long as the Origin Soul lives

156
00:10:33,630 --> 00:10:35,000
the body is eternal !

157
00:10:35,750 --> 00:10:37,560
We're at the same stage,

158
00:10:37,510 --> 00:10:38,880
you can't kill me.

159
00:10:39,950 --> 00:10:42,200
You just wait for my Senior Brother to arrive.

160
00:10:43,110 --> 00:10:45,000
This is a refining bell,

161
00:10:45,310 --> 00:10:48,080
an ancient artifact that can trap people and refine them.

162
00:10:48,590 --> 00:10:50,450
It's only a matter of time

163
00:10:50,270 --> 00:10:52,240
before your Origin Soul dies.

164
00:10:55,390 --> 00:10:56,240
I beg you,

165
00:10:56,150 --> 00:10:57,240
listen to me !

166
00:10:57,390 --> 00:10:58,400
Let me go !

167
00:10:58,630 --> 00:11:00,160
I will give you my Soul Blood !

168
00:11:00,070 --> 00:11:01,200
Too late...

169
00:11:03,230 --> 00:11:05,250
Once we get his bag of holding,

170
00:11:05,390 --> 00:11:08,120
we will be able to use the teleportation formations

171
00:11:08,190 --> 00:11:09,600
of the Da Lou Sword Sect.

172
00:11:10,110 --> 00:11:11,880
Master, you are so smart !

173
00:11:12,230 --> 00:11:14,760
Refining his Origin Soul will take time.

174
00:11:15,790 --> 00:11:17,520
This matter cannot be rushed.

175
00:11:18,390 --> 00:11:21,160
A few days later

176
00:11:22,190 --> 00:11:24,830
It's a pity that these thousand-years old trees

177
00:11:24,710 --> 00:11:26,320
are all dead.

178
00:11:26,820 --> 00:11:29,120
If I could use those trees

179
00:11:29,670 --> 00:11:31,270
for wood carving,

180
00:11:31,070 --> 00:11:33,240
who knows how powerful it could be.

181
00:11:37,460 --> 00:11:38,520
This is...

182
00:11:39,150 --> 00:11:40,760
a Celestial's cave ?

183
00:11:44,390 --> 00:11:46,040
Although this cave is empty,

184
00:11:46,830 --> 00:11:48,680
there are many restrictions here

185
00:11:48,910 --> 00:11:50,560
that are useful to me.

186
00:11:52,060 --> 00:11:54,800
Once the 9999th restriction is complete,

187
00:11:55,630 --> 00:11:57,000
the Restriction Flag

188
00:11:57,310 --> 00:11:59,000
will be upgraded again.

189
00:12:01,590 --> 00:12:04,090
Save me

190
00:12:06,610 --> 00:12:09,890
Save me

191
00:12:09,640 --> 00:12:15,090
Save me

192
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:10,510
This mountain has existed for a long time.

193
00:12:10,350 --> 00:12:12,800
I am not the first person to find this.

194
00:12:13,280 --> 00:12:14,800
How can this place

195
00:12:15,140 --> 00:12:16,720
still exist ?

196
00:12:17,670 --> 00:12:20,390
Even if a Celestial is locked up down there,

197
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:22,120
it's not something I can deal with.

198
00:12:25,230 --> 00:12:28,000
3 days later

199
00:12:29,190 --> 00:12:30,600
The time has come.

200
00:12:37,590 --> 00:12:38,810
This is...

201
00:12:38,560 --> 00:12:40,570
So many top-quality spirit stones !

202
00:12:40,750 --> 00:12:41,570
Master,

203
00:12:41,470 --> 00:12:43,640
we're rich now !

204
00:12:44,670 --> 00:12:45,720
You rat,

205
00:12:45,790 --> 00:12:46,840
accept your fate !

206
00:12:58,430 --> 00:13:00,720
You... were prepared for it ?

207
00:13:00,860 --> 00:13:02,760
If I didn't want to keep this sword,

208
00:13:03,150 --> 00:13:05,360
you wouldn't even have had time to act.

209
00:13:07,550 --> 00:13:10,000
This sword has hundreds of restrictions carved on it.

210
00:13:10,550 --> 00:13:12,600
It's somewhat similar to my Restriction Flag.

211
00:13:17,670 --> 00:13:19,610
Our Da Lou Sword Sect

212
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:23,440
found 37 fragments of the Celestial Realm.

213
00:13:23,630 --> 00:13:26,440
Each of them has a teleportation formation.

214
00:13:26,680 --> 00:13:28,120
By holding this jade

215
00:13:28,110 --> 00:13:30,650
and using spirit stones, one can activate the formations

216
00:13:30,430 --> 00:13:32,400
to travel between them at will.

217
00:13:33,270 --> 00:13:35,320
This jade is very important,

218
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:38,240
it must not fall into the hands of outsiders.

219
00:13:38,990 --> 00:13:41,120
This place is completely destroyed.

220
00:13:41,550 --> 00:13:44,040
I don't feel any celestial spiritual energy.

221
00:13:44,750 --> 00:13:45,930
So why did they

222
00:13:46,390 --> 00:13:48,840
set up the teleportation formation here ?

223
00:13:50,590 --> 00:13:51,440
Hurry up !

224
00:13:51,510 --> 00:13:52,760
Someone's here ?

225
00:13:53,830 --> 00:13:55,080
Okay, I got it.

226
00:13:55,870 --> 00:13:58,040
I don't know how many Celestials will come this year.

227
00:13:56,910 --> 00:13:58,520
Celestials ?

228
00:13:58,910 --> 00:14:01,090
They look real

229
00:14:00,950 --> 00:14:03,660
but I can't feel any Life energy from them.

230
00:14:03,590 --> 00:14:05,360
I think it's some kind of illusion.

231
00:14:23,270 --> 00:14:24,320
This is...

232
00:14:25,510 --> 00:14:27,760
A Celestial Palace of the past ?

233
00:14:54,630 --> 00:14:55,640
Ye Jiu,

234
00:14:55,400 --> 00:14:57,680
you can't escape today, come.

235
00:14:58,310 --> 00:14:59,090
Stop.

236
00:14:59,710 --> 00:15:02,120
This year's Celestial fruit is extra sweet.

237
00:15:07,910 --> 00:15:10,480
Yesterday, Celestial Bi Bo invited me to play a song together.

238
00:15:10,390 --> 00:15:11,850
How is that possible ?

239
00:15:11,710 --> 00:15:12,840
Let's get drunk !

240
00:15:12,620 --> 00:15:13,480
Cheers !

241
00:15:14,350 --> 00:15:16,440
Sister, one more dance.

242
00:15:37,510 --> 00:15:40,320
It's as if heaven and earth are in their hands.

243
00:15:40,190 --> 00:15:41,640
They can bend it at will

244
00:15:42,390 --> 00:15:44,360
in an infinite number of ways.

245
00:15:45,110 --> 00:15:47,040
Is this a celestial spell ?

246
00:15:50,230 --> 00:15:52,040
The Celestial Realm is strong.

247
00:15:52,430 --> 00:15:54,280
How was it destroyed ?

248
00:16:05,230 --> 00:16:07,480
Who's trespassing in the Celestial Realm !?

249
00:16:11,510 --> 00:16:13,280
A palm ?

250
00:16:24,950 --> 00:16:26,000
Fight back !

251
00:16:47,910 --> 00:16:49,520
This palm strike

252
00:16:50,150 --> 00:16:52,440
can move mountains and split the seas.

253
00:16:51,510 --> 00:16:52,730
Little sister !

254
00:16:53,800 --> 00:16:55,840
Although this palm is an illusion,

255
00:16:55,810 --> 00:16:57,400
I can still learn from it.

256
00:17:15,030 --> 00:17:16,080
One move.

257
00:17:16,550 --> 00:17:19,040
The Celestial Realm was destroyed in one move !

258
00:17:42,660 --> 00:17:49,590
Falling from the night sky and melting into dust
like water without a source.

259
00:17:49,410 --> 00:17:55,750
Like the difference between clouds and mud,
the truth cannot be found in conflict.

260
00:17:55,610 --> 00:17:59,690
Life and death
are like the moment when the rain falls

261
00:17:59,470 --> 00:18:03,620
and like many other unseparable things.

262
00:18:03,730 --> 00:18:09,630
In this lifetime,
to cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.

263
00:18:10,560 --> 00:18:16,640
Old grudges had to be settled
because half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.

264
00:18:16,700 --> 00:18:22,490
Use the most vivid love and hate
to ask questions to your fate.

265
00:18:22,700 --> 00:18:27,170
Let your eyes be filled enough with rage
to pierce the heart and the soul

266
00:18:27,180 --> 00:18:30,660
then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.

267
00:18:30,580 --> 00:18:36,650
Only when you bend down can you understand
the hidden edge of the blade.

268
00:18:36,920 --> 00:18:40,850
The human mind is nature,
the rain fell silently like an answer.

269
00:18:40,700 --> 00:18:44,770
Life and death are just moments away,
there are many other solutions to grudges.

270
00:18:44,700 --> 00:18:50,620
Use your dusty heart
to depict the world.

271
00:18:50,630 --> 00:18:54,550
One stroke is for killing.
After struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

272
00:18:54,510 --> 00:18:58,330
One stroke is for caring.
Everywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

273
00:18:58,200 --> 00:19:04,370
Give up your mind to be refined
by this endless world.

274
00:19:04,190 --> 00:19:08,450
The human mind is nature,
the rain fell silently like an answer.

275
00:19:08,230 --> 00:19:12,270
Life and death are just moments away,
there are many other solutions to grudges.

276
00:19:12,610 --> 00:19:18,100
Use your dusty heart
to depict the world.

277
00:19:17,920 --> 00:19:22,050
One stroke is for killing.
After struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

278
00:19:21,840 --> 00:19:25,890
One stroke is for caring.
Everywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

279
00:19:25,940 --> 00:19:31,750
Give up your mind to be refined
by this endless world.

280
00:19:32,140 --> 00:19:38,610
Snow falls as my hair turns white, winter withers
while prosperity sprouts in summer.

281
00:19:38,660 --> 00:19:45,410
I step into the world, with light at my fingertips,
the law of cause and effect.

282
00:19:46,180 --> 00:19:52,130
I observe the vastness of heaven and earth so I can get rid of evil.

283
00:19:52,050 --> 00:19:59,000
Obsession arises from one thought, life and death arise from one thought.
Reincarnation is not to be feared.
